# Local co-dev overlay (path repos for base-beam packages) — never commit
composer.local.json

# Ecosystem-local orientation pointer — never commit
CLAUDE.md

# Scribe generator output — the OpenAPI artifact is generated in the DEPLOYED environment
# (docker/entrypoint.sh), never committed. `scribe:generate` also emits an intermediate cache and,
# because Scribe publishes them unconditionally, the HTML docs assets/views this tier does not serve
# (`scribe.laravel.add_routes` is false — beam core owns `beam/openapi.{yaml,json}`; see
# beam-docs-satellite 38). The artifact itself is already covered by storage/app/private/.gitignore.
/.scribe
/public/vendor
/resources/views/scribe
